      "source": [
        "**BIVARIATE ANALYSIS**\n",
        "\n",
        "dealing with two variables at the same time\n",
        "\n",
        "an aggregate statistic is a way a creating a single number that describes a group of numbers\n",
        "\n",
        "common aggregate statistics include mean, median, and standard deviation"
      ],
      "metadata": {
        "id": "wi_mhApU2zbM"
      }
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": [
